 Date** | **Time** | **Activity** | **Location** | **Notes (Infant-Friendly Tips)** | **Cuisine/Meal Details**.\n\n**Tone:** Informative, encouraging, and realistic. Avoid overly packed schedules. Emphasize flexibility, saying \"If energy allows...\" or \"This can be swapped with...\" for optional items.\n\n**Essential Inclusions:**\n- Thursday: Check",
