   "source": "lmsys",
   "prompt": "\"\"\"\nTable departments, columns = [id is department id, dn is department name]\nTable students, columns = [id is student id, sn is student name, did is department id]\nCreate a MySQL query for all students in the Computer Science Department\n\"\"\"",
   "response": "Looking at the tables:\n- `departments`: columns `id` (department id), `dn` (department name)\n- `students`: columns `id` (student id), `sn` (student name), `did` (department id)\n\nHere's the MySQL query to find all students in the Computer Science Department:\n\n```sql\nSELECT s.id, s.sn, s.did\nFROM students s\nJOIN departments d ON s.did = d.id\nWHERE d.dn = 'Computer Science';\n```\n\nOr using a subquery approach:\n\n```sql\nSELECT id, sn, did\nFROM students\nWHERE did IN (\n    SELECT id\n    FROM departments\n    WHERE dn = 'Computer Science'\n);\n```\n\nBoth queries will return the student id, student name, and department id for students in the Computer Science Department.",
