   "prompt": "Please group the name-value pairs into different categories based on name and provide name for each group tagged <h3>  \n,for example SYS names group name is System Information , GPU names group name is GPU Information , CPU names group name is CPU information.  \nAnd also provide source of your information with header<h3> and list the useful websites to get more information about the product as clickable hyperlinks with <href> tag in the end with tag <ui> . \nComputer hardware or software PRODUCT description is : \"PC Gamer Concórdia Intel Core i7-10700F, 16GB, SSD 480GB e HD 1TB, RTX 2060, Fonte 650W, Windows 10 Pro - 30224\" ,PRODUCT number  : \"PC Gamer Concórdia Intel Core i7-10700F, 16GB, SSD 480GB e HD 1TB, RTX 2060, Fonte 650W, Windows 10 Pro - 30224\" , \nTechinical Specifications required are :{SYS Model Number, SYS Manufacturer, SYS BUS Type, SYS Product Type, SYS Brand,\tSYS Brand Consumer or Commercial, SYS Brand Series,  \nSYS Dimensions, SYS Form Factor, SYS Memory Size, SYS Memory Type, SYS Memory Interface, SYS ODD, SYS OS, SYS Panel Type, SYS Platform,   \nSYS Output Display Port (True/False) , SYS Output GSYNC (True/False) , SYS Output HDMI (True/False) ,SYS Output Thunderbolt(True/False) ,SYS Output VGA   \nSYS Screen Refresh Rate, SYS Screen Resolution, SYS Screen Size, SYS Storage Capacity, SYS Storage Type, SYS Weight,   \nSYS Z Height , GPU Model Number, GPU Architecture, GPU Base Clock, GPU Boost Clock, GPU Brand, GPU Class, GPU Cooling,   \nGPU Discrete (True/False) ,GPU ITX (True/False) ,GPU Low Pr",
   "response": "Here is the grouping of the name-value pairs based on the provided product description, along with the requested sources and useful links.\n\n### System Information\n- **SYS Model Number:** PC Gamer Concórdia Intel Core i7-10700F, 16GB, SSD 480GB e HD 1TB, RTX 2060, Fonte 650W, Windows 10 Pro - 30224\n- **SYS Manufacturer:** (Not specified in the description, likely a custom builder/retailer)\n- **SYS BUS Type:** (Not specified)\n- **SYS Product Type:** Desktop PC (Gaming)\n- **SYS Brand:** (Not specified, likely a local/internet brand \"Concórdia\")\n- **SYS Brand Consumer or Commercial:** Consumer\n- **SYS Brand Series:** Concórdia\n- **SYS Dimensions:** (Not specified)\n- **SYS Form Factor:** Mid Tower (typical for gaming desktops)\n- **SYS Memory Size:** 16 GB\n- **SYS Memory Type:** DDR4 (implied by generation of CPU and GPU)\n- **SYS Memory Interface:** (Not specified, likely DDR4-2666 or DDR4-2933)\n- **SYS ODD:** (Not specified, likely None)\n- **SYS OS:** Windows 10 Pro\n- **SYS Panel Type:** (Not specified, as this is a desktop, not a laptop/monitor)\n- **SYS Platform:** PC (Desktop)\n- **SYS Output Display Port (True/False):** True (typical for RTX 2060)\n- **SYS Output GSYNC (True/False):** True (implied by RTX 2060)\n- **SYS Output HDMI (True/False):** True (typical for RTX 2060)\n- **SYS Output Thunderbolt (True/False):** False (not standard on desktop RTX 2060)\n- **SYS Output VGA:** False (no modern GPU supports VGA)\n- **SYS Screen Refresh Rate:** (Not specified, depends on monitor)\n- **SYS Screen Resolution:** (Not specified, depends on monitor)\n- **SYS Screen Size:** (Not specified, depends on monitor)\n- **SYS Storage Capacity:** 480GB (SSD) + 1TB (HDD)\n- **SYS Storage Type:** SSD (480GB) + HDD (",
