   "source": "dailydialog",
   "prompt": "Which film shall we see?",
   "response": "That's a great question, but the best answer depends entirely on your mood! Since I can't read your mind (yet!), let me give you a few options based on what kind of night you're after.\n\n**Pick a number or a feeling:**\n\n1.  **\"I want to laugh until I cry.\"** -> See ***Everything Everywhere All at Once*** (If you haven't already). It's a hilarious, chaotic, and surprisingly touching multiverse adventure.\n2.  **\"I want to be on the edge of my seat.\"** -> See ***Dune: Part Two***. It's an epic, visually stunning sci-fi masterpiece with incredible action and tension.\n3.  **\"I want a deep, thought-provoking drama.\"** -> See ***Oppenheimer***. A dense, powerful, and brilliantly acted historical drama about the man behind the atomic bomb.\n4.  **\"I want something fun and light.\"** -> See ***Barbie***. It's a bright, clever, and surprisingly funny movie that's much more than just a toy commercial.\n5.  **\"I want a stylish, intense thriller.\"** -> See ***Saltburn*** (if you're okay with something weird and dark). It's a twisted, gorgeous, and shocking social satire.\n\n**Or, if you just tell me a little more, I can give you a perfect pick:**\n\n- **What's the last movie you really loved?**\n- **Are you in the mood for action, comedy, drama, or horror?**\n- **Is this a solo trip, a date, or a group outing?**\n\nLet me know, and I'll narrow it down for you!",
